#: general.cpp:148
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Checking this option will close any\n"
"open connection when the X-server is\n"
"shut down. You should enable this option\n"
"unless you know what you are doing.\n"
"\n"
"See <a href=\"#disxserver\">here</a> for more on this."
